<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Exito Q1 net up 18.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Exito Q1 net up 18.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's second largest supermarket chain Exito reported the following first quarter results, the securities superintendency said Tuesday:</p>
<p>		   Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit     6.66 bln pesos	5.6 bln pesos</p>
<p>Total assets 394.03 bln pesos    304.1 bln pesos</p>
<p>Oper income  207.8 bln pesos     159.5 bln pesos</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
